# NF C 15-100:2024 board templates — DRAFTS, UNVERIFIED.
#
# Illustrative starting points (T1–T5, with and without electric heating),
# drawn from the rules core's 2015 shapes already encode; nobody has checked
# them against the published norm, and the 2024 shapes they are validated
# against are themselves marked UNVERIFIED. Every template is dht:verified
# false until a named person verifies it in the cloud.
#
# A SEED: written once to stage with scripts/templates.mjs. The cloud is the
# source from then on (darkfactory ADR-0017); do not edit this file to change
# a template.

@prefix dht:  <https://digitalhome.cloud/templates#> .
@prefix dhc:  <https://digitalhome.cloud/ontology#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

<https://digitalhome.cloud/id/templates/nfc15100-2024/t1> a dht:BoardTemplate ;
